  "description": "The GeekVape Aegis Mini 2 is a mighty vape mod that’s super-compact, ergonomic and incredibly durable. The Aegis Mini 2 mod (also called the M100) can fire up to 100W thanks to the built-in 2500mAh battery, which can be charged quicker than ever thanks to super-fast Type-C USB connection. A larger screen displays all your useful data and settings, and the USB-C port is concealed beneath a dust-proof cover, while a handy ‘A-lock’ prevents accidental fires. The Aegis Mini 2 M100 mod now boasts Tri-Proof protection which means even more resilience to water, dust and shocks, making an already rugged vape kit even hardier, making the Aegis Mini 2 ideal for vapers who lead an active lifestyle. The Aegis Mini 2 mod pairs perfectly with another GeekVape favourite, the new Z Nano 2 2ml Tank, but its 510-thread connection makes it compatible with many other tanks should you prefer. Intended for sub-ohm vaping and coils suitable for High-VG e-liquids and long-lasting Shortfills .",
